OL,3,GNEWSABid for more money to fund
OL,4,Abenefits pulled
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns benefit cuts would have to be
OL,7,Fmade if more money was not freed up
OL,8,Fhave been eased during debate on the
OL,9,FStates of Guernsey's 2027 Budget.
OL,11,FEmployment and Social Security (ESS)
OL,12,Fhad warned without extra funding it
OL,13,Fwould have to cut the income threshold
OL,14,Ffor family allowance or freeze benefits
OL,15,Fwhile it considered its options.
OL,17,FHowever, after ESS president Tina Bury
OL,18,Fsaid "intensive and constructive"
OL,19,Fconversations with Policy & Resources
OL,20,F"over the last 24 hours" had led to the
OL,21,Fcommittee withdrawing its motion asking
OL,22,Ffor up to #3.8m.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
