OL,3,GNEWSABid for more money to fund
OL,4,Abenefits pulled
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident of P&R Lindsay de Sausmarez
OL,7,Fsaid the committee supported the
OL,8,Fdecision to withdraw the amendment, but
OL,9,Fwhat was agreed behind the scenes
OL,10,Fremains unclear.
